{"job":"lawn-r4-b-qa","role":"qa","purpose":"交叉审查纹理边界与已知草纹的联合门限","name":"accept_wrap_trial","fields":["old_x","old_y","new_x","new_y","detail_change","tolerance"],"specification":"Return 1 when tolerance>=0, both new excess means no larger than old counterparts to numerical epsilon 1e-9, at least one improves beyond epsilon, and abs(detail_change)<=tolerance; otherwise zero. All excess values are finite nonnegative. Distinguish a pass on this texture test from full-scene acceptance.","handoff":[{"taskId":"lawn-r4-a-qa","actualResponseText":"{
  "name": "seam_excess",
  "expression": "max(0, across - (left + right) / 2)",
  "implementation": "上游在同材质、尺度与方向一致的配对窗口中计算线性亮度绝对差，分别传入 across、left、right。以两侧均值为自然基线；结果与输入同量纲，越大表示局部接缝的超额对比度越高。",
  "limits": "假定输入为有限非负数。仅衡量接缝异常，不判定草色或种植合理性。所提供的照片哈希及未分割的8位sRGB统计仅作背景；未核验原图，这些统计不能直接作为所需的线性亮度差。不同物理相机的未对齐照片不得逐像素配对。"
}","responseTextSha256":"9979680269c9d3032c2e61309fdaac102e242d658b03344ca3418d8f9aeb4484","externallyTestedCases":64},{"taskId":"lawn-r4-a-seam","actualResponseText":"{
  "name": "lawn_feather",
  "expression": "0 if width <= 0 or distance <= 0 else confidence if distance >= width else confidence * (distance / width) ** 2 * (3 - 2 * (distance / width))",
  "implementation": "传入以米计的有符号距离 distance、过渡宽度 width 和置信度 confidence。返回值作为有效投影纹理权重，其补值作为程序草地权重；先应用铺装、设施与树干净空排除遮罩。正宽度时采用三次 smoothstep，过渡两端导数均为零。",
  "limits": "要求输入为有限实数且 confidence 在 [0,1]；width 非正时返回零。仅使用用户提供的现场描述与采样元数据作为背景，未查看或核验原始照片，也未从非分割统计推导配准或草地标签。此函数仅平滑权重，不能单独消除色差、投影错位或纹理细节不连续。"
}","responseTextSha256":"73bd539354a695fa1522b546dec37d5c8bd5ce40c345f15d66c596c0e26f05dc","externallyTestedCases":80},{"taskId":"lawn-r4-a-scale","actualResponseText":"{
  "name": "detail_mix",
  "expression": "0 if far <= near else (1 if distance <= near else (0 if distance >= far else min(1, max(0, 1 - 3 * ((distance - near) / (far - near)) ** 2 + 2 * ((distance - near) / (far - near)) ** 3))))",
  "implementation": "将 distance、near、far 统一为世界空间米制距离；表达式返回细草权重，过渡单调下降且两端一阶导数为零。近远表示使用同一世界坐标与固定种子生成对应草簇，以该权重渐隐或稳定抖动，勿按距离硬切，以减轻可见 LOD 圆环；保留路面、设施及树干净空排除遮罩。",
  "limits": "假定输入为有限实数；far<=near 时返回零，不处理 NaN 或无穷值。该权重本身不能消除种子、密度或材质不一致产生的接缝。仅依据所给照片采样统计及几何描述作背景，未读取原图或实测标定；未分割统计不能确定草叶尺度或 near/far，不同物理相机的像素不可直接配对。"
}","responseTextSha256":"4d111824f1f6c00cbe367dca68fdd58a96cc6868cc836a333b620e2d6d611d96","externallyTestedCases":225}],"evidence":{"A_unitCases":{"tone":990,"seam":80,"scale":225,"contact":144,"qa":64},"textureAB":[{"texture":"Turf.PhotoAlbedo","sourceSHA256":"7a9ff0cb094ca2a1e9eef5334a8dd96c7dbf492bfc40bc71c19410b10fa4a12a","width":512,"height":512,"linearLight":true,"edgeBandTexels":12,"A":{"horizontalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.018846105312593352,"meanExcess":0.009025769238703955,"p90Excess":0.025090957949817503},"verticalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.015752556260163194,"meanExcess":0.008902971872897321,"p90Excess":0.025140837581026202},"nearBorderDirectionalMean":0.014143483843114927},"B":{"horizontalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.0,"meanExcess":0.0,"p90Excess":0.0},"verticalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.0,"meanExcess":0.0,"p90Excess":0.0},"nearBorderDirectionalMean":0.014173618349051256},"interiorMaxChange":0.0,"borderMeanAbsDifference":0.0038170761200905508,"notes":"Controlled CPU trial on actual embedded RGB texture. A original; B paired opposite-edge RGB offsets over a 12-texel smoothstep band; B fixes repeat boundary, not necessarily the interior atlas/material seam visible in the render. Same static texture tested, no change to geometry or photo observations."},{"texture":"Turf.RegisteredDiffuse","sourceSHA256":"dd2ff3244a196d10c3642341bcf8d8930b5d3adce1262ab7d1705e08c4695454","width":2048,"height":2048,"linearLight":true,"edgeBandTexels":12,"A":{"horizontalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.007432764697555175,"meanExcess":0.0030904598559529247,"p90Excess":0.009946971791221636},"verticalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.00792711762375415,"meanExcess":0.003957286092964291,"p90Excess":0.01192964486928222},"nearBorderDirectionalMean":0.005641196584585377},"B":{"horizontalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.0,"meanExcess":0.0,"p90Excess":0.0},"verticalWrap":{"meanWrapDifference":0.0,"meanExcess":0.0,"p90Excess":0.0},"nearBorderDirectionalMean":0.005719055738447261},"interiorMaxChange":0.0,"borderMeanAbsDifference":0.0016610886950196265,"notes":"Controlled CPU trial on actual embedded RGB texture. A original; B paired opposite-edge RGB offsets over a 12-texel smoothstep band; B fixes repeat boundary, not necessarily the interior atlas/material seam visible in the render. Same static texture tested, no change to geometry or photo observations."}]},"trialInterpretation":"Read textureAB A and B as results of the first CPU trial on two actual embedded project textures. Images were decoded from the published mesh. Neither result is a camera render. Evaluate your contribution on this same fixed input without claiming the visible whole-lawn seam is solved. Deliver a function used in a second actual pixel-buffer trial."}
